<title>HONG KONG: Crocodile interim net rises 95.56 pct.</title>
<headline>Crocodile interim net rises 95.56 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended January 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.7    vs 1.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0    vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    22.88  vs 11.70</p>
<p>    Turnover		     656.30 vs 525.38</p>
<p>    Company name		 Crocodile Garments Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 2-6</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 13</p>
<p>NOTE - Crocodile Garments, which is 54.93 pct owned by Lai Sun Garment (International) Ltd, makes and sells garments. It is also involved in property investment and development, operating restaurants and investment dealing.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
